    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="36.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 36.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ealdormon sie, ðolie his scire, buton him kyning arian wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he is an ealdorman, let him forfeit his shire, unless the king is willing to show him mercy.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he is an ealdorman he shall forfeit his shire, unless the king is willing to pardon him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ealdormon sie, þolige his scire, buton him se cyning arian wille.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
